source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Manage data export destinations

Usage: vendo destinations [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list            List all destinations
  get             Get destination details
  sync            Trigger a manual sync
  refresh-source  Check source-data availability for a window and trigger top-up imports for missing ranges
  pause           Pause a destination
  resume          Resume a paused destination
  delete          Delete a destination (soft delete)
  create          Create a new destination (source → destination pipeline)
  update          Update a destination
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
